@host = http://localhost:8080
@token = replace-with-access-token
@startDate = 2026-06-08
@endDate = 2026-06-14
@procedureId = replace-with-procedure-uuid

### Total de envios de questionário por dia
GET {{host}}/api/presentation/metrics/daily-checkins?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Pacientes com leitura de saúde (dado do smartwatch) por dia
GET {{host}}/api/presentation/metrics/daily-smartwatch-patients?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alertas encaminhados ao médico por dia
GET {{host}}/api/presentation/metrics/daily-alerts?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Média diária dos campos numéricos do procedimento
### startDate e endDate devem cobrir sete dias inclusivos; a resposta inclui os sete anteriores.
GET {{host}}/api/presentation/metrics/procedures/{{procedureId}}?startDate={{startDate}}&endDate={{endDate}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
